"""Bibliographic records and search outcomes authored after opening the sources.

This is a serialization program, not a literature-search substitute. 'Verified'
means the linked source was opened; the scope column says whether its theorem,
proof, metadata, or only a cited reference was inspected. No third-party full
text is redistributed. Search records group closely related claims explicitly.
"""
